The **Weathered Salaryman** works hard to provide for his family, and
he's glad his labor has earned promotions and kept them secure.
Somewhere in all those hours at his desk, though, there may have been
dreams he once had. He can't remember. *Knowledge (Business) +2, Smart
+1, Wealthy +2; Clumsy -1, Dull -1, Languid -1, Restricted Freedom
(Chained to Desk) -1.*

